WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.364 --> 00:00:17.893
"I hope Zing stays and waits at the Hollow," Zann said.

2
00:00:17.913 --> 00:00:20.214
"I know he wanted to come along.

3
00:00:21.074 --> 00:00:23.356
But I'm afraid he'd attract too much attention."

4
00:00:24.216 --> 00:00:26.217
Zann and his friends were walking to town.

5
00:00:26.478 --> 00:00:28.139
Dawn was breaking over the swamp.

6
00:00:28.879 --> 00:00:33.994
The aurora birds were singing, and lights were coming on in the outlying homes the kids were passing.

7
00:00:34.955 --> 00:00:35.695
Darb shrugged.

8
00:00:35.715 --> 00:00:37.976
"I did my best to convince him to stay."

9
00:00:38.737 --> 00:00:40.058
That wasn't very comforting.

10
00:00:40.738 --> 00:00:47.782
The dragon could be unpredictable, plus Zann knew that Zing, like all magical creatures, hated being anywhere near

11
00:00:47.842 --> 00:00:48.323
the Hollow.

12
00:00:49.123 --> 00:00:51.224
Still, there wasn't much he could do about it.

13
00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:54.246
They were soon in the more populated part of town.

14
00:00:54.266 --> 00:00:56.668
"Be careful," Zann warned.

15
00:00:57.312 --> 00:01:01.194
"We don't know what's been going on around here since we went into hiding yesterday."

16
00:01:02.294 --> 00:01:03.415
Gliss rubbed her stomach.

17
00:01:03.435 --> 00:01:05.176
"Was it only yesterday?

18
00:01:05.196 --> 00:01:08.277
I feel as if I haven't eaten in days!"

19
00:01:08.297 --> 00:01:09.778
"Me too.

20
00:01:10.158 --> 00:01:12.039
But we can eat later," Zann said.

21
00:01:12.059 --> 00:01:16.021
"First we need to get to my house and look for that diary.

22
00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:19.883
And quickly, because Morb could have spies anywhere."

23
00:01:20.563 --> 00:01:22.604
Just then a door slammed nearby.

24
00:01:23.448 --> 00:01:27.210
A dragon scurried into the street and let out a yip and a puff of steam.

25
00:01:28.751 --> 00:01:33.694
It was a vapor bounder, a popular breed due to its small size and friendly disposition.

26
00:01:33.714 --> 00:01:35.395
"Hazi, stop!"

27
00:01:35.835 --> 00:01:36.495
a voice called.

28
00:01:37.136 --> 00:01:39.997
A kid rushed out of the house and scooped up the lively dragon.

29
00:01:40.017 --> 00:01:41.598
"It's Jev!"

30
00:01:41.978 --> 00:01:42.699
Gliss exclaimed.

31
00:01:43.359 --> 00:01:46.601
Before Zann could stop her, she rushed forward, calling his name.

32
00:01:46.621 --> 00:01:50.283
"Jev!" Their classmate turned, looking surprised.

33
00:01:50.303 --> 00:01:52.104
"Gliss!" he exclaimed.

34
00:01:53.132 --> 00:01:53.772
"You're okay!

35
00:01:54.112 --> 00:01:57.113
Everyone heard your parents are you know gone.

36
00:01:57.853 --> 00:01:59.794
We assumed whoever took them took you too."

37
00:01:59.814 --> 00:02:02.274
"He almost did," Gliss said.

38
00:02:02.294 --> 00:02:04.735
"Zann and Darb and Perda saved me."

39
00:02:04.755 --> 00:02:07.876
"Oh." Jev glanced at the others as they caught up.

40
00:02:07.896 --> 00:02:10.657
"Yeah, we thought Zann got nabbed too.

41
00:02:11.377 --> 00:02:13.097
Especially after what happened to his house."

42
00:02:13.838 --> 00:02:18.619
Jev's tone made it very clear that he wasn't particularly concerned about the loss of Zann's house.

43
00:02:18.639 --> 00:02:23.536
"If you'll excuse us, we've got something important to do," said Zann.

44
00:02:24.216 --> 00:02:25.017
Jev ignored him.

45
00:02:25.037 --> 00:02:29.978
"I can't believe you guys are still around," he said, talking mostly to Gliss and Perda.

46
00:02:30.818 --> 00:02:32.479
"Most of the Reds in town are gone.

47
00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:36.700
The only ones left are the mayor and a couple of others who are hiding out with her

48
00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:37.540
at the town hall."

49
00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:40.681
"So Morb hasn't broken the mayor's Shield spell?"

50
00:02:40.981 --> 00:02:41.561
Gliss asked.

51
00:02:41.581 --> 00:02:42.982
"Who's Morb?"

52
00:02:43.302 --> 00:02:43.742
Jev said.

53
00:02:43.762 --> 00:02:48.023
"He's the guy who's been taking all the Reds," Perda explained.

54
00:02:48.043 --> 00:02:50.003
"Wait," Zann put in.

55
00:02:50.023 --> 00:02:53.037
"We don't have time to—" It was too late.

56
00:02:53.357 --> 00:02:55.519
The girls told Jev everything they'd found out.

57
00:02:56.239 --> 00:02:57.861
Zann felt anxious as he listened.

58
00:02:58.141 --> 00:03:00.643
He didn't like the idea of telling his enemy all their secrets.

59
00:03:01.444 --> 00:03:02.465
"Wait," Jev said.

60
00:03:02.485 --> 00:03:05.207
"Are you telling me this Morb guy is a Void?"

61
00:03:06.188 --> 00:03:07.929
He glanced at Darb and smirked.

62
00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:09.370
"No way.

63
00:03:09.631 --> 00:03:13.514
Everyone knows Voids are useless at magic and most other things too."

64
00:03:14.174 --> 00:03:15.275
Darb didn't respond.

65
00:03:16.036 --> 00:03:20.480
Zann clenched his fists to stop himself from giving Jev another set of donkey ears.

66
00:03:21.268 --> 00:03:23.849
"We need to keep moving," he told his friends.

67
00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:26.911
"You'd better be careful," Jev said.

68
00:03:26.931 --> 00:03:31.573
"A bunch of tiny, weird-looking dragons have been flying around town stinging people."

69
00:03:31.593 --> 00:03:33.433
"Stinging dragons?"

70
00:03:33.834 --> 00:03:36.575
Darb spoke for the first time since they'd bumped into Jev.

71
00:03:36.595 --> 00:03:38.375
"What do they look like?"

72
00:03:38.395 --> 00:03:41.717
"Don't ask me; I didn't see them," Jev said.

73
00:03:41.737 --> 00:03:46.699
"But I heard they swarmed the school last night and grabbed some papers or something from the office."

74
00:03:47.699 --> 00:03:49.400
Darb looked at Zann.

75
00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:52.742
"Those could be the same tiny dragons we saw in the swamp yesterday."

76
00:03:53.502 --> 00:03:54.223
Zann shrugged.

77
00:03:54.243 --> 00:03:56.004
"Maybe," he said.

78
00:03:56.024 --> 00:03:59.005
"But listen, we really need to get moving."

79
00:03:59.025 --> 00:04:01.527
"Zann's right," Perda said.

80
00:04:02.267 --> 00:04:03.248
She turned to Jev.

81
00:04:03.448 --> 00:04:06.249
"Will you do me a favor and tell my family that I'm okay?"

82
00:04:06.269 --> 00:04:09.051
"Mine too," Darb put in quietly.

83
00:04:09.071 --> 00:04:11.612
"Please?" "Why should I?"

84
00:04:12.012 --> 00:04:12.573
said Jev.

85
00:04:13.273 --> 00:04:15.174
"Please, Jev," said Gliss.

86
00:04:15.194 --> 00:04:18.516
"My parents would be going crazy with worry if it were me."

87
00:04:19.328 --> 00:04:20.429
Her lower lip trembled.

88
00:04:20.449 --> 00:04:22.350
"If they were still around, I mean."

89
00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:25.011
"Okay, okay," Jev said quickly.

90
00:04:25.371 --> 00:04:26.172
"I was just kidding.

91
00:04:26.612 --> 00:04:27.132
I'll tell them."

92
00:04:27.813 --> 00:04:30.374
Just then the dragon in his arms wriggled loose.

93
00:04:30.394 --> 00:04:32.795
"Hey! Get back here, Hazi!"

94
00:04:33.416 --> 00:04:36.297
He rubbed his hands together, conjuring up a dragon harness.

95
00:04:37.278 --> 00:04:38.859
Then he chased after his pet.

96
00:04:39.779 --> 00:04:40.560
Zann grimaced.

97
00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:45.422
It felt strange to know that he couldn't even conjure up something as simple as that harness right

98
00:04:45.482 --> 00:04:48.264
now. He wasn't used to living without magic.

99
00:04:48.736 --> 00:04:49.676
How did Darb do it?

100
00:04:49.696 --> 00:04:52.197
"Let's go," he told his friends.

101
00:04:52.217 --> 00:04:54.818
"We've wasted enough time already."

102
00:04:55.718 --> 00:04:57.539
Soon they were several blocks away.

103
00:04:57.559 --> 00:05:02.380
"We should have asked Jev to conjure some breakfast for us," Perda said.

104
00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.961
"Oh!" Gliss stopped short.

105
00:05:04.981 --> 00:05:07.381
"Why didn't I think of that?

106
00:05:07.722 --> 00:05:08.962
Maybe we should go back."

107
00:05:09.742 --> 00:05:10.642
Zann stopped too.

108
00:05:10.662 --> 00:05:12.223
"We don't have time."

109
00:05:13.003 --> 00:05:15.944
Just then his stomach grumbled and he thought of something.

110
00:05:16.728 --> 00:05:19.509
"Why are we assuming that Perda can't use magic?

111
00:05:20.309 --> 00:05:21.229
She's not a Red.

112
00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.770
I'm sure it's safe for her to conjure some breakfast for us."

113
00:05:25.831 --> 00:05:27.671
"Do you really think that's a good idea?"

114
00:05:27.991 --> 00:05:29.131
Darb seemed dubious.

115
00:05:30.472 --> 00:05:32.252
"That makes total sense, Zann!"

116
00:05:32.652 --> 00:05:33.132
said Gliss.

117
00:05:33.152 --> 00:05:35.653
"Morb's only after Reds, right?

118
00:05:36.433 --> 00:05:40.394
Perda can probably do all the magic she wants, and Morb won't care at all."

119
00:05:41.075 --> 00:05:42.035
Perda licked her lips.

120
00:05:42.055 --> 00:05:44.936
"How do puckerberry pancakes sound?"

121
00:05:44.956 --> 00:05:46.972
"Great," Zann said.

122
00:05:46.992 --> 00:05:47.853
"But hurry."

123
00:05:48.573 --> 00:05:51.795
Perda rubbed her hands together, and then held them facing upward.

124
00:05:52.655 --> 00:05:55.237
A second later a steaming platter of food appeared.

125
00:05:56.277 --> 00:05:57.998
"Yum!" Gliss exclaimed.

126
00:05:58.679 --> 00:06:03.481
Just then a large, hulking figure appeared, casting a dark shadow over everyone.

127
00:06:04.242 --> 00:06:05.842
Then another figure appeared.

128
00:06:06.183 --> 00:06:06.683
And another.

129
00:06:07.343 --> 00:06:10.785
Perda screamed and dropped the plate of food, which shattered at her feet.

130
00:06:10.805 --> 00:06:15.027
"Trolls!" she cried.
